     1257         with FRAME BottomFrame width 235 PAGE-BOTTOM NO-LABELS NO-BOX .
     1258     VIEW stream PrnLibStream FRAME BottomFrame .
     1259     FORM with FRAME f-doc .
     1260     PUT stream PrnLibStream SPACE(30) "Сальдо по поставщикам" SKIP .
